  "details": "In PCVR (SteamVR), the A and X buttons on the Quest2 controller are not assigned properly.\n\nIn the world gimmick, the element originally activated by the A button does not work, and pressing the X button causes A to react at the same time.\n\nThis problem can be seen in the world using the chikuwa vehicle system.(ex. https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_2a3df68a-86a8-4949-86a3-f4cac379ac0a)\n\nGo to the front of the UI panel for key configurations and select the VR HandSteer Full preset.\n\nThe A button will be assigned to Turn Signal R and the X button to Turn Signal L, but it should not work correctly.\n\nYou can check it in the test area at the bottom of the UI panel.",
